# Layout ladder, step 6 (plan/20-core-domain/29-layout-ladder.md): the cooling loop -- a junction, a
# three-way valve and its recirculation, a supply and a return. The m2-cooling-loop sample verbatim.

fluidscript 1
circuit coolingLoop
fluid water

HE1 heat_exchanger power=30 in=20 out=50
3WV three_way_valve
PU1 pump
P1  pipe length=25 dn=25

connections
N1 - N2
N2 - PU1
PU1 - HE1
HE1 - 3WV
3WV - N2
3WV - P1
P1 - N3

N1 inlet t=6 p=300
N3 outlet p=280
